  "\n<details class=\"activity-disclosure\">\n<summary data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-l09-check-toggle\">Open chapter check: Central control</summary>\n<section class=\"activity\" data-activity=\"check-cns\" data-activity-mode=\"paired\" data-required-check=\"\">\n<h2 data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-783\">Check: Central control</h2>\n<p data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-784\">Chapter check \u00b7 Select Start when ready. The elapsed timer includes breaks; Submit and finish stops it. Redo preserves earlier attempts.</p>\n<div class=\"save-row\">\n<button type=\"button\" data-start=\"\" data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-785\">Start</button>\n<output data-timer=\"\">Not started</output>\n</div>\n<fieldset data-run-body=\"\" disabled=\"\">\n<div class=\"question\" data-question=\"check-cns-mc\">\n<h3 data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-786\">Which of the following is NOT one of the structures or mechanisms designed to protect the human brain?</h3>\n<label class=\"choice\" data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-787\">\n<input type=\"radio\" name=\"check-cns-mc\" value=\"QUES_51674_82710_A275474\" data-answer=\"\"> the cerebrospinal fluid that circulates through the brain and spinal cord</label>\n<label class=\"choice\" data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-788\">\n<input type=\"radio\" name=\"check-cns-mc\" value=\"QUES_51674_82710_A275475\" data-answer=\"\"> the medulla oblongata</label>\n<label class=\"choice\" data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-789\">\n<input type=\"radio\" name=\"check-cns-mc\" value=\"QUES_51674_82710_A275476\" data-answer=\"\"> the meninges</label>\n<label class=\"choice\" data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-790\">\n<input type=\"radio\" name=\"check-cns-mc\" value=\"QUES_51674_82710_A275477\" data-answer=\"\"> the blood-brain barrier</label>\n<button type=\"button\" data-check=\"\" data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-791\">Check answer</button>\n<p data-feedback=\"\" role=\"status\" data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-792\">\n</p>\n<fieldset class=\"paired-writing\" data-unlock=\"check-cns-mc\" disabled=\"\">\n<legend>Explain the related idea</legend>\n<p data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-793\">\nIdentify the main structures of the central nervous system, and describe its general functions. </p>\n<p data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-794\">\n<a href=\"#textbook-library\" data-book-page=\"30\" data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-795\">Textbook p. 389</a>\n</p>\n<label for=\"check-cns-written\" data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-796\">Written response</label>\n<textarea id=\"check-cns-written\" data-writing=\"check-cns-written\" data-answer-limit=\"3200\" rows=\"6\" aria-describedby=\"check-cns-written-limit check-cns-written-status\"></textarea>\n<p id=\"check-cns-written-limit\" class=\"muted\" data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-797\">Up to 3200 characters. Drafts can be longer, but must fit before submission. Writing is not automatically graded.</p>\n<button type=\"button\" data-submit-writing=\"\" data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-798\">Save written response</button>\n<p data-writing-status=\"\" id=\"check-cns-written-status\" role=\"status\" data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-799\">\n</p>\n</fieldset>\n</div>\n</fieldset>\n<button type=\"button\" data-submit-run=\"\" data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-800\">Submit and finish</button> <button type=\"button\" data-redo=\"\" hidden=\"\" data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-801\">Redo activity</button>\n<p data-run-status=\"\" role=\"status\" data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-802\">\n</p>\n</section>\n</details>\n<details class=\"activity-disclosure\">\n<summary data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-l09-practice-toggle\">Open optional source practice: Central control</summary>\n<section class=\"activity\" data-activity=\"practice-cns\" data-activity-mode=\"writing\">\n<h2 data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-803\">Source practice: Central control</h2>\n<p data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-804\">Optional source practice \u00b7 Select Start when ready. The elapsed timer includes breaks; Submit and finish stops it. Redo preserves earlier attempts.</p>\n<div class=\"save-row\">\n<button type=\"button\" data-start=\"\" data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-805\">Start</button>\n<output data-timer=\"\">Not started</output>\n</div>\n<fieldset data-run-body=\"\" disabled=\"\">\n<div class=\"question\" data-question=\"source-checkpoint-20\">\n<p data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-806\">\nExplain how the blood-brain barrier and the cerebrospinal fluid protect the brain and spinal cord. </p>\n<p data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-807\">\n<a href=\"#textbook-library\" data-book-page=\"30\" data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-808\">Textbook p. 389</a>\n</p>\n<label for=\"source-checkpoint-20-written\" data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-809\">Written response</label>\n<textarea id=\"source-checkpoint-20-written\" data-writing=\"source-checkpoint-20-written\" data-answer-limit=\"3200\" rows=\"6\" aria-describedby=\"source-checkpoint-20-written-limit source-checkpoint-20-written-status\"></textarea>\n<p id=\"source-checkpoint-20-written-limit\" class=\"muted\" data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-810\">Up to 3200 characters. Drafts can be longer, but must fit before submission. Writing is not automatically graded.</p>\n<button type=\"button\" data-submit-writing=\"\" data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-811\">Save written response</button>\n<p data-writing-status=\"\" id=\"source-checkpoint-20-written-status\" role=\"status\" data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-812\">\n</p>\n</div>\n</fieldset>\n<button type=\"button\" data-submit-run=\"\" data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-813\">Submit and finish</button> <button type=\"button\" data-redo=\"\" hidden=\"\" data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-814\">Redo activity</button>\n<p data-run-status=\"\" role=\"status\" data-c